      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimarigizo, enehu nakuambirani mhuvoyere ili neno ra Mlungu rigote upesi na kuphokerwa na ishima dza ko kpwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya huvoyereni Mlungu ahurinde na atu ayi, mana sio osi ambao andakubali kuamini hiri neno ra Mlungu huribisharo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Bwana Jesu ni muaminifu, na andakutiyani nguvu na kukurindani na mai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye wahuhenda hukale na hakika kukala munahenda na mundaenderera kuhenda hurigolagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu naakulongozeni mmanye mendzwaye na vira Bwana Jesu arivyovumirira mateso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, kpwa uwezo wa Bwana Jesu Masihi swino hunakuonyani mdziepushe na afuasi ayawenu ambao ni avivu na taalunga gara hurigokufundzani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mwimwi enye mnamanya mlondwavyo kuiga mfwano wehu. Huriphokala hiko kpwenu tahuyakala avivu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wala tahuyarya chakurya cha mutu bila kuchiriphira. Chinyume na hivyo, hwakala na chadi cha kuhenda kazi usiku na mutsi, ili husikale mzigo kpwa mutu yeyesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Swiswi tahuyahenda hivi kpwa kukala tahuna haki ya msada wenu, ela hwalonda hukale mfwano mnono ambao mundaulunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana hata huriphokala hosi hwakulagizani hiri: “Yeyesi ambaye ni mvivu wa kazi, naasirye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sababu ya kuamba hivyo, hwasikira kukala ayawenu anjina ni avivu. Taana rorosi ahendaro isiphokala kuinjirira mambo ga atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu dza hinyo hunaaonya na kuaambira kpwa uwezo huriohewa ni Bwana Jesu Masihi kukala, ahurire na adzitsumire chakurya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwi enehu, msiremwe kuhenda manono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeyesi ndiyerema kulunga higa hubishago kpwenye baruwa yehu, dzimanyirireni naye, tsona dzitengeni naye ili agbwirwe ni haya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo msimuhende kala ni adui, ela mkanyeni dza myawenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
